SUMMARY:Arts Journalism Initiative Launch
DESCRIPTION:The Arts Journalism Initiative is launching May 20th! Come le
 arn more about the templates\, grants database and funding tips provided 
 in this dynamic platform to increase arts coverage in your community.  Th
 e Initiative is developed by 2025-'26 RJI Fellow Rebecca Ritzel (https://
 rjionline.org/?s=&amp\;post_type=post&amp\;person_id=30262).
X-ALT-DESC;FMTTYPE=text/html:<p>  The Arts Journalism Initiative is launc
 hing May 20th! Come learn more about the templates\, grants database and 
 funding tips provided in this dynamic platform to increase arts coverage 
 in your community.<br /><br />  The Initiative is developed by 2025-'26 R
 JI Fellow <a href="https://rjionline.org/?s=&amp\;post_type=post&amp\;per
 son_id=30262">Rebecca Ritzel</a>.</p>
